<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<style>
  body { width: 360px; font: 13px/1.5 "Microsoft YaHei", system-ui, sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 12px; }
  h1 { font-size: 14px; margin: 0 0 4px; }
  .sub { color: #666; font-size: 12px; margin: 0 0 10px; }
  .dry { display: inline-block; background: #fff3cd; color: #8a6d00; border: 1px solid #ffe08a;
         border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 6px; font-size: 11px; margin-left: 6px; }
  button { width: 100%; padding: 9px; font-size: 13px; border: 0; border-radius: 6px;
           background: #2f6fed; color: #fff; cursor: pointer; }
  button:disabled { background: #9db8ee; cursor: default; }
  pre { background: #0f1420; color: #d6e2ff; border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px; margin: 10px 0 0;
        white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-all; max-height: 320px; overflow: auto; font-size: 12px; }
  .ok { color: #7ee787; } .bad { color: #ff9d9d; } .warn { color: #ffd479; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>海外仓发货助手 <span class="dry">排雷 · DRY</span></h1>
  <p class="sub">验证合成点击能否驱动 ERP 的 vxe-table。<br>
     <b>只全选（可逆）+ 定位物流下单按钮，绝不真下单。</b></p>
  <button id="run">在当前 ERP 页面排雷</button>
  <pre id="out">请先在浏览器打开并登录赛狐 ERP 的【待处理】订单页，再点上面按钮。</pre>
  <script src="popup.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
